WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.635
Prepare three likely questions about the supplied fictional

00:00:02.705 --> 00:00:06.966
intake tabletop. First: what assumption was tested, what

00:00:07.036 --> 00:00:10.298
failed, and what changed? Point to the three

00:00:10.356 --> 00:00:14.269
retained checks and the revised approval state. Second:

00:00:15.163 --> 00:00:17.368
who is affected and who reviews a correction?

00:00:17.717 --> 00:00:20.189
Identify the fictional project author and the review

00:00:20.259 --> 00:00:25.771
route; real organizational roles remain unestablished. Third: what

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.824
costs and permissions need checking before wider use?

00:00:29.556 --> 00:00:32.156
No live costs or savings were measured, and

00:00:32.226 --> 00:00:34.966
no customer deployment is authorized by this training

00:00:35.024 --> 00:00:38.321
example. A good answer states what the evidence

00:00:38.344 --> 00:00:41.305
supports, identifies the limit, and names the next

00:00:41.351 --> 00:00:45.775
check. AI may ask practice questions. It must

00:00:45.844 --> 00:00:48.898
not invent results or answer for you. Deliver

00:00:48.956 --> 00:00:51.765
your own explanation and save three question-response notes

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:52.775
with the presentation.
